 3. ⚡️ Catch me up 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Image: Amazon MGM Studios 🎬 English actor Robert Pattinson will be the next James Bond, Amazon MGM announced today. He said in a statement: "James Bond is one of the most legendary characters in cinema, and to be entrusted with 007 is the honor of a lifetime." Denis Villeneuve is directing what will be the first Bond movie in the franchise's Amazon MGM era. More from Variety ... Read the announcement . 🧑‍⚖️ Lindsay Clancy will face a second trial in March in the killings of her three young children. Her first trial ended in a mistrial after jurors couldn't reach a unanimous verdict on whether she was criminally responsible for their deaths. Get the latest . 🇨🇳 The Trump administration released a new rule to close a loophole that allowed sensitive U.S. tech to reach China through data centers in Southeast Asia. Go deeper . Composite photo: AP P.S. Previous actors who've portrayed James Bond (from left): Sean Connery, David Niven, George Lazenby, Roger Moore, Timothy Dalton, Pierce Brosnan and Daniel Craig. 

 
 
