 4. 🎸 1 for the road: Raye ties Bey 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Raye performs in Dublin in March. Photo: Kieran Frost/Redferns English singer-songwriter Raye leads the 2027 Grammy Award nominations, revealed today.

 She's up for 11 awards at February's ceremony: record, song and album of the year — the first time she's been nominated in those categories — as well as songwriter of the year/non-classical, a variety of pop categories, and music video. 🐝 That's a tie with Beyoncé's record for the most nominations in a single year by a female artist, set last year.

